ComfyUI-BluePixel

This repository contains integration and conversion code, not model weights.

Primary sources:
- vivo/BluePixel, code revision 3a39b77133b1e08d724a0f45b316ccfa5c3b2acc.
  Its code is provided under Apache-2.0. Model materials also include separate
  notices and an OpenAtom model license document.
- openvivo/BluePixel-Turbo, model revision
  e9c7a641a4bcd9851eef50c1ce9b07fa44f6044c.
- Comfy-Org/ComfyUI, native model and node APIs, GPL-3.0-or-later.
- Hugging Face Diffusers and Transformers, Apache-2.0.
- Comfy-Org/comfy-kitchen, native INT8 ConvRot implementation, Apache-2.0.

The Apache-2.0 license text for attributed source portions is included at
docs/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Integration changes are marked by this project;
the repository's own source license is GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

The upstream BluePixel NOTICE identifies FLUX.2 Klein base weights under a
FLUX Non-Commercial License, while the Hugging Face card uses Apache-2.0
metadata and the source repository contains additional model license material.
Those statements have not been resolved into a single permission grant here.
Preserve and review each component's original model terms before redistribution.
This project's source license does not relicense the underlying weights.

Qwen3 and DCAE attribution and terms remain those of their original authors.
No source checkpoint, converted weight, local research, or private roadmap is
included in the source distribution.
